name: Accept an existing partial Map and inherit exact context without regeneration
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_MODEL=openai-codex:gpt-5.5
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/existing_context_map.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: use sast
submit: options sast:scan
require-live-snap: 20 sast:scan | options
submit: set taskMode manual
submit: set tasks secret-scan
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | form
keys: Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CHOOSE STUDY CONTEXT | context-catalog
keys: Up m
require-live-snap: 20 Inspect an exact revision | inspection-required
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CONTEXT SUMMARY | exact-context
expect: m Map
expect: Partial deterministic Map
ask: Does the inspected source context expose Map review without suggesting regeneration or workspace activation?
resize: 160x48
live-snap: context-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: context-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: context-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: context-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: context-40x12
expect: m Map
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage
live-snap: context-tail-40x12
ask: Are inspection, Map review, diagram, generation and back controls understandable at 40x12, with actual paging reaching the final guidance?
resize: 120x36
keys: m
require-live-snap: 30 Acknowledge & use partial | pending-map
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/existing_context_map.py @TMP_TARGET @ART pending
ask: Does the Map result preserve its partial status and require an explicit operator decision?
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 20 Map ✓ | accepted-map
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/existing_context_map.py @TMP_TARGET @ART accepted
keys: Escape
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | inherited-study
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 Draft ready | planned-study
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/existing_context_map.py @TMP_TARGET @ART planned
keys: Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 20 Model: | planned-identities
ask: Does the finite study inherit the accepted exact context while keeping model, allowance and approval decisions visible?
keys: Escape
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_MODEL=openai-codex:gpt-5.5 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
expect: Map ✓
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/existing_context_map.py @TMP_TARGET @ART planned
ask: After no-color restart, does accepted partial context survive with unchanged source, active context and zero provider work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
